# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 (a block's lines are one binding group: a line reads a hold or an event bound below it; a building `match`'s arm stands at the block's next positions) and ch. 8 (the line below the `match` reads its plain result at the build): the first label follows `$gone`, which the button below the `match` steps.
test a_line_above_reads_a_hold_bound_below

